OL,3,APupil arrested after two teachers shot
OL,4,Aat French school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pupil has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fprincipal and teacher were shot at a
OL,8,Fschool in southern France on Monday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FThe 14-year-old entered Lakanal middle
OL,12,Fschool in Aubagne, a small city 11
OL,13,Fmiles east of Marseille, "with a
OL,14,Fshotgun inside a guitar case". He then
OL,15,Fopened fire before being restrained by
OL,16,Fa member of staff, regional officials
OL,17,Ftold French media.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
