OL,3,APupil arrested after two teachers shot
OL,4,Aat French school
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo children were harmed and the
OL,7,Fteachers have been treated for injuries
OL,8,Fwhich are not life-threatening,
OL,9,Faccording to Aubagne Mayor Jean-Pierre
OL,10,FSquillari, who said the suspect was a
OL,11,Fpupil in the ninth grade.
OL,13,FThe Marseille prosecutor's office has
OL,14,Fsince opened an investigation for
OL,15,Fattempted murder, it said in a
OL,16,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
